  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Clicking on the buttons below allows for different ways to edit the individual
    tiles on the map. Changing a tile influences the travel time that tile offers,
    making it possible to change the routes of the enemies.:


    Pathfinding: LMB
    sets a start location and RMB sets a goal location. If both are on the map it
    creates a path to the shortest point. Always place one of them down to update
    the pathfinding.


    Structures: LMB creates a tower on the tile. RMB creates
    a wall. Walls are more of an obstacle to the enemy pathfinding.


    Terrain:
    LMB cycles through the different terains. Different terrains offer different
    movement costs through them, making it so that enemies will try and avoid them
    for quicker paths. Grey is normal terrain, the quickest path. Orange is second
    quickest, and green is the slowest. Black terrain cannot not be passed through.


    Height:
    LMB adds a tile ontop of the base tile. RMB removes the highest tile from the
    base tile.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
